      "id": "b08c55a4",
      "agent_input": "I\u2019d like to create a short report listing my won deals from the Q3 sales file\u2014specifically D001, D003, D006, and D009 with their amounts. Please help me generate this report and save it as a new file.",
      "agent_response": {
        "response": "[Awaiting tool approval]\n\n**Policy:** Shell command approval (skills demo)\nAbout to run a shell command in the agent workspace. Approve to continue?\n**Required Tools:** run_command\n```python\nsales_data = await read_file(\"./workspace/data/sales_q3.csv\")\nprint(sales_data)\n\nwon_deals_data = await read_file(\"./workspace/data/james_okafor_won_deals.csv\")\nprint(won_deals_data)\n\nimport re\n\n# Parse the sales_q3.csv\nlines = sales_data.strip().split('\\n')\nheader = lines[0]\nprint(f\"Header: {header}\")\n\n# Parse all rows\ntarget_ids = {\"D001\", \"D003\", \"D006\", \"D009\"}\nmatched_deals = []\n\nfor line in lines[1:]:\n    # CSV parsing - split by comma\n    fields = line.split(',')\n    deal_id = fields[0].strip()\n    if deal_id in target_ids:\n        matched_deals.append(fields)\n\nprint(f\"\\nMatched {len(matched_deals)} deals:\")\nfor d in matched_deals:\n    print(d)\n\nskill_instructions = await load_skill(\"OfficeBench\")\nprint(skill_instructions)\n\nimport asyncio\ninstall_result = await run_command(\"uv pip install openpyxl python-docx pdf2image pytesseract python-pptx\")\nprint(install_result)\nawait asyncio.sleep(5)\n\n# Parse the CSV header and data\nlines = sales_data.strip().split('\\n')\nheaders = [h.strip() for h in lines[0].split(',')]\nprint(f\"Columns: {headers}\")\n\n# Find the target deals\ntarget_ids = {\"D001\", \"D003\", \"D006\", \"D009\"}\nwon_deals = []\n\nfor line in lines[1:]:\n    fields = [f.strip() for f in line.split(',')]\n    deal_id = fields[0]\n    if deal_id in target_ids:\n        deal_dict = dict(zip(headers, fields))\n        won_deals.append(deal_dict)\n\nprint(f\"\\nFound {len(won_deals)} target deals:\")\nfor d in won_deals:\n    print(d)\n\n# Calculate total\ntotal = 0\nfor d in won_deals:\n    amount_str = d.get('Amount', d.get('amount', '0'))\n    # Remove $ and commas\n    amount_clean = amount_str.replace('$', '').replace(',', '').strip()\n    total += float(amount_clean)\n\nprint(f\"\\nTotal amount: ${total:,.2f}\")\n\n# Build the report content\nreport_lines = []\nreport_lines.append(\"# Q3 Won Deals Report\")\nreport_lines.append(\"\")\nreport_lines.append(f\"**Deals Selected:** D001, D003, D006, D009\")\nreport_lines.append(\"\")\n\n# Build table header from actual column names\ncol_names = list(won_deals[0].keys())\nreport_lines.append(\"| \" + \" | \".join(col_names) + \" |\")\nreport_lines.append(\"| \" + \" | \".join([\"---\"] * len(col_names)) + \" |\")\n\n# Build table rows\nfor d in won_deals:\n    row = \"| \" + \" | \".join(d[c] for c in col_names) + \" |\"\n    report_lines.append(row)\n\nreport_lines.append(\"\")\nreport_lines.append(f\"**Total Amount: ${total:,.2f}**\")\nreport_lines.append(\"\")\nreport_lines.append(\"---\")\nreport_lines.append(\"*Report generated from workspace/data/sales_q3.csv (Q3 Sales Data)*\")\n\nreport_content = \"\\n\".join(report_lines)\nprint(report_content)\n\nwrite_result = await write_file(\"./workspace/data/Q3_Won_Deals_Report.md\", report_content)\nprint(write_result)\n```",
